class AuthenticatedState implements ATMState {
    public void insertCard(ATM atm, Card c) { throw new IllegalStateException("card already in"); }
    public void enterPin(ATM atm, int pin)  { throw new IllegalStateException("already authed"); }
    public void withdraw(ATM atm, int amount) {
        atm.dispenser().dispense(amount);     // valid here
        atm.setState(new IdleState());        // transition back
    }
}
// ATM.withdraw(amt) just calls currentState.withdraw(this, amt) -- no flags.
```
*Adding a new phase = adding a class, not editing every method.*

